// On Linux, set via: export MY_FLAG=""
// .NET 9 breaking change: empty env vars are no longer treated as unset.
// Previously GetEnvironmentVariable("MY_FLAG") returned null for both
// unset and empty. Now it returns "" for empty, null only when truly unset.
